notes = "The actual observed Incense spatial UUID owns finite response selection. Producer0c2e5a0d7 now discloses that same source_condition_uuid on each actual positive unblocked HealFact; its canonical pre-result public spatial snapshot selects this reusable Cure Wounds receiving source. The exact healed actor supplies the actual receiving geometry. No proximity, display description, current held-mace inference, synthetic actor condition or dedicated Incense artwork is required. Visual scope is these actual healed recipients; the field ledger draws no extra bulk cloud. All artwork is unreviewed and this source assignment is unvalidated."
